@startuml view-4
title View 4 - Reservation lifecycle (state machine)
[*] --> ACTIVE : makeReservation
ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : cancel (>= 6h before slot start)
ACTIVE --> CONFIRMED : checkIn (same day, <= start + 10 min)
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : manageEnd (scheduler, now > start + 10 min)
CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED : manageEnd (scheduler, now > slot end)
CONFIRMED --> CONFIRMED : cancel / checkIn rejected
note right of ACTIVE : ACTIVE and CONFIRMED occupy the seat\n(ReservationRegistry.occupiesSlot)
note bottom of CANCELLED : Cancelled/Expired/Completed free the seat
@enduml
